e  tva's headquarters so this takes place  right after avengers end game where loki  stole the tesseract and disappeared as  you can see he's wearing the same exact  suit and the guard that has captured him  has the tesseract in her hand  we then get a better look at the inside  of the tva and we get a look at the  three statues which are  the time keepers the original founders  of the tva  and speaking of connections to ant-man  quantomania at one point in time king  the conqueror is believed to be a time  keeper he has done many things  throughout many different timelines  because king the conqueror  is the master of time time travel and  loki says he actually knows what this  place is and the time keepers have built  quite the circus  and we actually see the three faces of  the time keepers again behind gugu mumba  raw  and her character has still yet to be  revealed to us but it's clear that she  works for the tva  there is speculation that she could  perhaps be ravenna langsliger who at one  point in time was a love interest of  kang the conqueror  now as we go through the tva through the  different scenes we can see many  different hourglasses on some of the  walls and some of the doors and there  are clocks just  everywhere and if you notice they all  have different times because they are  for different timelines now we hear owen  wilson finally talk about what the tva  actually does and he says the tva  protects the proper flow of time and  this is a direct callback to what the  ancient one was telling professor hulk  in avengers endgame she was specifically  talking about how the infinity stones  all together created what they perceived  as the flow of time and if you removed  one of the infinity stones  essentially everything would go to chaos  which is what we see here in this  trailer when they show us different  timelines this is all due  to loki taking the tesseract taking the  space stone out of that main timeline  the flow of time for the main timeline  has been disrupted and is now thrown  into chaos and these other timelines are  being thrown into chaos as well  as you can see on this screen where they  show the main timeline and the branches  breaking off  now owen wilson's character is mobius m  mobius and in the series he seems to be  the one that is in charge of the tva  and he tells loki that he needs his help  to fix it and when loki asks why he says  i need your  unique loki perspective now the reason  that he needs  this unique loki perspective is because  in each of these variant  timelines loki is the main problem and  the reason they're all going into chaos  now they are different versions of loki  like the female loki that we see many  many times throughout the trailer that  we'll talk about in just a second  we have president loki that is shown in  one scene and then there are just  other variations of different timelines  where loki is at the center of the chaos  so they are essentially using  r loki that is the main star of the show  to track down and defeat  different versions of himself in other  timelines because remember that's what  the tva's job is protecting the flow of  time  making sure one timeline does not affect  another timeline  but also making sure all timelines are  okay loki gets dumped into an office  where we see a man with his cat  and he shows us that the tva keeps  record of literally everything  anybody says at any point in time  throughout their entire lives he says  please sign to verify this is everything  you've ever said  then he says this is absurd and a new  paper prints out because he said more  words so he has to sign  for those new words as well but on this  piece of paper we actually learned  something here  at the very top of the new piece of  paper it says variant  l1130 the l obviously standing for loki  and the 1130 obviously being the variant  that this loki is because this is not  the main  loki the main loki is our main loki from  the main  avengers timeline our main mcu timeline  this is the same loki that got killed by  thanos during avengers infinity war so  that was the main loki from the main  timeline and any other loki that exists  in a different timeline is just a  variant of that main loki including the  one that we're going to be following  throughout this show  we even hear a character at one point in  time say you really believe in this loki  variant again calling him a variant  because he's not the true loki he even  wears a jacket that says variant on the  back of it now the main antagonist  of the show besides this actual loki  himself because remember this isn't the  same  mature loki that we knew that died in  avengers infinity war that went through  thor ragnarok and essentially his  redeeming arc this is a loki who just  got taken after the events of avengers  end game still a very evil loki  so he will be a hero and antagonist  himself but the main antagonist looks to  be  female loki some people thought that  this could be black widow in the scene  where loki is sitting right next to her  but it's more like him  talking to himself which is going to be  a very very interesting scene to see  just because loki is very clever and  this female version of himself the one  that tends to wear the hood seems to be  very smart clever and quick  so it'll be interesting to hear her  motive for doing everything  now the tva seems to travel throughout  different points of time through these  doors and at one point in time it looks  like female loki gets one of the guards  and is able to open a door for her to go  through this is most likely the main  loki that the tva is trying to capture  and why they need  our loki's help now we go through many  different alternate timelines that we  see throughout this trailer and then at  the end we can see loki holding his arms  up  looking at owen wilson's character  mobius and there's a big explosion and a  lot of dust coming at them in the  background this is no doub